; Corwin — the muster-yard lane guard (GDD-03 §4.A A1; docs/11 plan Step 2).
; Same CC0 R13 character pipeline as player.tscn: Quaternius Superhero Male
; body driven at runtime by the UAL library (npc_corwin.gd copies it in).
; GuardBlueMat stands in for T_YRD_CLOTH_TABARD "Guard blue" (deviation D7)
; and is pinned on the body mesh inside the Hero instance.
; Deliberately no PhysicsBody/CollisionShape — "blocks nothing" (S2).
